WEBVTT

00:25:29.663 --> 00:25:31.496
and more grateful to be employed.

00:25:31.746 --> 00:25:34.079
I don't mean to diminish the very serious

00:25:34.079 --> 00:25:37.371
and real obstacles that people who are
graduating, but any recession face,

00:25:37.371 --> 00:25:40.288
but that there may be sort of
this long term silver lining

00:25:40.788 --> 00:25:44.871
if you take your silver lining of people
being more satisfied with their jobs.

00:25:45.579 --> 00:25:48.746
I worry that that's going to open the
door for leaders to exploit them,

00:25:49.246 --> 00:25:52.913
that people who might have
exited completely abusive

00:25:52.913 --> 00:25:55.871
or toxic workplace will stay
because they say, hey,

00:25:55.871 --> 00:25:58.204
I'm lucky to have a job. Is that a risk?

00:25:58.413 --> 00:25:59.996
Absolutely. I worry about that, too.